  "title": "review: S1 v6: land the green S1 commit 3925705 under gate-parseable acceptance ids",
  "spec": "Respec of T-1347. T-1347's implementation is done and green (tests-green OK 1504 at 3925705 on branch task/T-1347, run by the Planner 2026-09-23), but its acceptance named tests as tests/x.py::Class::test, which acceptance.missing_tests (acceptance.py:8) reads as a function named after the class, so the daemon gate held it as gate_red. The acceptance below uses the parseable tests/x.py::test_name form. Spec content is unchanged from T-1347 (read it with bus_read T-1347 for the full design: pool.executor_rows / executor_identity, claude-row headroom, codex_available Codex-only, daemon review_tier/_security_review_tier/_open_reviews with cfg and fail-closed lookup).\n\nWhat to do: bring commit 39257054621b73dcb9177ec16f42c494d238ae8c (branch task/T-1347) onto this task's branch (git cherry-pick 3925705), resolve nothing else, run the gate, commit. Only change code if the cherry-pick conflicts or the gate is red on this base; then keep the T-1347 design exactly. No new behaviour, no pool.toml edit, no new dependencies.",
  "inputs": [
    "T-1352"
  ],
  "acceptance": [
    "tests/test_pool.py::test_identity_row_legacy_unknown",
    "tests/test_pool.py::test_claude_row_needs_account_headroom",
    "tests/test_pool.py::test_codex_only_never_calls_pick",
    "tests/test_pool.py::test_codex_available_true_beside_heavier_claude_row",
    "tests/test_daemon.py::test_claude_row_on_sonnet_model_reviewed_by_opus",
    "tests/test_daemon.py::test_claude_row_on_opus_model_reviewed_by_sonnet",
    "tests/test_daemon.py::test_codex_none_unknown_and_modelless_keep_default",
    "tests/test_daemon.py::test_legacy_claude_tiers_unchanged_without_models_table",
    "tests/test_daemon.py::test_lookup_failure_fails_closed",
    "tests/test_daemon.py::test_open_reviews_loads_config_at_most_once",
    ".claude/hooks/tests-green.sh wt/<this task> exits 0"
